1
00:02:12,870 --> 00:02:19,890
Visit turkision.com for more!

2
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:23,399
My son.

3
00:02:28,600 --> 00:02:32,079
Gunduz Bey is alright.

4
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:35,439
We stitched his wound, he
stopped bleeding thank Allah.

5
00:02:35,640 --> 00:02:38,759
Thank you my Allah.

6
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:43,839
-Is he conscious?
-He is conscious, my Bey.

7
00:02:44,440 --> 00:02:46,599
He wants to see everyone.

8
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:49,959
Especially my brother and Elcim Hatun.

9
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:58,159
Come on then.

10
00:02:59,600 --> 00:03:04,879
Father, stop. Don't push yourself.

11
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:09,439
Look at her. These wounds are nothing.

12
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:13,759
-I am alright, no need to worry.
-Gunduz Bey.

13
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:19,239
Praise be, you look alright. You will be better
if Allah permits.

14
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:23,119
-Get well soon Gunduz Bey.
-Thank you.

15
00:03:23,480 --> 00:03:25,199
I am healed alright.

16
00:03:25,480 --> 00:03:30,439
We have to see our children's
wedding, right Osman Bey?

17
00:03:33,920 --> 00:03:39,439
You get on your feet first. If Allah permits,
we will ask for her hand in marriage.

18
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:49,359
It is appropriate. I will get up
until tomorrow, will be at Yenisehir.

19
00:03:49,760 --> 00:03:53,639
Elcim, my daughter. You go too.

20
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:59,839
Help out with the preparations.
Besides, Ayca is here.

21
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:03,799
No, father I won't leave
you. I will stay here as well.

22
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:09,319
You should be there when
Malhun Hatun hears the good news.

23
00:04:09,480 --> 00:04:13,759
This is how it should be. I am alright here.

24
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:18,559
Besides, you are getting married..

25
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:23,119
..for our righteous cause,
for the future of our tribes.

26
00:04:23,280 --> 00:04:26,719
From now on, you will first
think about our righteous cause..

27
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:29,799
..then each other.

28
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:39,279
From now on, you will have more
enemies than you have friends.

29
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:47,839
And your wisdom will protect
your hourse first, then your people.

30
00:04:52,640 --> 00:04:58,239
Come on then. We are leaving Gunduz Bey, take care.

31
00:04:58,640 --> 00:05:01,599
You too, Osman Bey.

32
00:05:06,280 --> 00:05:10,479
My daughter, come on.

33
00:05:48,160 --> 00:05:53,079
Alps! March!

34
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:13,319
You took my castle from me!
You celebrated your victory!

35
00:06:13,440 --> 00:06:16,319
Did you think I wouldn't make you pay for it?

36
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:28,839
We took what is ours! We will take Atranos as well!

37
00:06:43,200 --> 00:06:46,279
I swear that I will rise..

38
00:06:46,520 --> 00:06:50,759
..on the heads I take from you!

39
00:06:57,160 --> 00:07:03,119
I will die here, however, you will lose.

40
00:07:03,840 --> 00:07:07,999
Shahzade Orhan will get married. Two Kayi Tribes..

41
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:11,799
..will be one from now on.

42
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:25,759
I will avenge my valiants..

43
00:07:26,040 --> 00:07:32,239
..who spilled their blood for
the last Shahzade of Seljuks!

44
00:07:49,920 --> 00:07:54,479
Tell me Benjamin. Will Olcaytu give me what I want?

45
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:58,679
Of course. What will we do with his carcass?

46
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:05,119
His tribe is next. Bury the alps.

47
00:08:05,280 --> 00:08:08,759
No one must learn about their death for now.

48
00:08:09,320 --> 00:08:15,319
When the time comes, I will send
Uras' head as a wedding gift to Osman.

49
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:19,719
It will be Osman's death invitation.

50
00:08:38,760 --> 00:08:45,799
O, Kite. We conquered you, however, it was hard.

51
00:08:47,040 --> 00:08:51,839
-Thank Allah, Osman Bey.
-Thank Allah indeed.

52
00:08:53,320 --> 00:08:56,159
-Come on alps.
-My Bey.

53
00:08:59,400 --> 00:09:04,679
There are news from our alp Hasan.

54
00:09:24,920 --> 00:09:28,079
Then, let Imren Tegin know..

55
00:09:28,240 --> 00:09:32,039
..I will be waiting for him..

56
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:35,399
..at here, Gorklu Valley..

57
00:09:35,520 --> 00:09:38,359
..to give Olcaytu's gifts.

58
00:09:38,520 --> 00:09:41,759
We will be there tomorrow to pick them up.

59
00:09:44,160 --> 00:09:48,279
Do not make promises you can
not hold. Isn't The Atranos Castle..

60
00:09:48,400 --> 00:09:51,199
..is under Osman's siege?

61
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:54,479
How will Imren Tegin leave from there?

62
00:09:54,920 --> 00:09:58,319
Osman thinks he blocked us by sieging there.

63
00:09:58,520 --> 00:10:02,439
However, there is a way
through passages, do not worry.

64
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:09,519
What is it, Osman Bey?

65
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:19,799
While we think we surrounded this dog Imren Tegin..

66
00:10:19,920 --> 00:10:23,399
..he is galloping around us.

67
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:35,799
What will Olcaytu send to Imren Tegin, my Bey?

68
00:10:35,960 --> 00:10:39,519
We will find out after going to
the meeting area before him.

69
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:42,079
Konur.

70
00:10:43,680 --> 00:10:47,679
Now, since he got away from this secret passage..

71
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:52,519
..then, we will continue the siege.
However, you will look everywhere.

72
00:10:52,680 --> 00:10:55,959
-You will find me that passage.
-As you command, my Bey.

73
00:10:56,280 --> 00:10:59,199
My Bey, what about Olivia?

74
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:01,999
What if Imren Tegin sent them?

75
00:11:06,960 --> 00:11:10,639
Do you hear what you are saying, Alaeddin?

76
00:11:12,560 --> 00:11:16,839
Did Holofira come here to stab me from the back?

77
00:11:17,360 --> 00:11:21,439
-Brother..
-Both Holofira and her aunt..

78
00:11:23,480 --> 00:11:26,399
..guilty or innocent.

79
00:11:26,920 --> 00:11:29,679
It will all be revealed.

80
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:36,119
Until then, this matter is
done. Son, mind your actions.

81
00:11:43,760 --> 00:11:47,199
We will find out, Osman Bey. If
they know about the passages..

82
00:11:47,480 --> 00:11:51,959
..if they came to the palace
for good or evil, we will find out.

83
00:11:52,080 --> 00:11:54,599
We will find out alright. Orhan.

84
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:56,759
-My Bey.
-Ready alps.

85
00:11:58,880 --> 00:12:06,159
Now, this message does not only
reveal the agreement between..

86
00:12:06,760 --> 00:12:11,159
..Imren and Olcaytu, but also the
source of information of Mongols..

87
00:12:11,400 --> 00:12:15,079
..how will they ambush us, how
they try to stab us from behind.

88
00:12:15,240 --> 00:12:21,279
Also, the location where they
send messages to Olcaytu.

89
00:12:23,520 --> 00:12:25,039
-Orhan!
-My Bey.

90
00:12:25,280 --> 00:12:27,360
We will destroy this place!

91
00:12:27,372 --> 00:12:29,239
As you command, my Bey.

92
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:33,839
-Alaeddin!
-My Bey.

93
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:39,439
Since they came out from that
passage, they might attack the tribes.

94
00:12:39,560 --> 00:12:43,639
-The protection of caravans is on you.
-As you command.

95
00:12:44,160 --> 00:12:50,319
My Bey, what if this Mongol
gives an army to Imren Tegin?

96
00:12:52,040 --> 00:12:54,719
What if we come across an army when we get there?

97
00:12:54,880 --> 00:12:58,239
Tajeddin wanted to stop us before the expedition.

98
00:12:58,560 --> 00:13:04,279
Olcaytu is at the expedition now.
Which means there can't be an army.

99
00:13:07,920 --> 00:13:11,079
If we take his head..

100
00:13:11,200 --> 00:13:14,759
..then the Mongol issue
will be dealth with. Come on!

101
00:13:33,920 --> 00:13:38,239
So Olcaytu Han wants me to take Osman's head..

102
00:13:38,520 --> 00:13:41,479
..in order to give me the
signs I rightfully deserved.

103
00:13:43,360 --> 00:13:45,959
That hound.

104
00:13:47,600 --> 00:13:49,679
I will take what I want in the end, Benjamin.

105
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:55,879
You will, my Tegin. Olcaytu wants to
make an agreement by giving them to you.

106
00:13:56,680 --> 00:13:59,439
I've waited for this day.

107
00:13:59,680 --> 00:14:05,959
The day that I will get my Seljuks
ancestors' signs has finally come.

108
00:14:16,280 --> 00:14:18,439
My friends.

109
00:14:18,880 --> 00:14:22,599
Today is the day.

110
00:14:23,760 --> 00:14:28,359
Time will witness our victory.

111
00:14:29,360 --> 00:14:33,639
I'm the descendant of Kay Kavus.

112
00:14:34,640 --> 00:14:37,399
The last heir standing.

113
00:14:38,760 --> 00:14:41,399
When I get the signs of my ancestors,

114
00:14:41,520 --> 00:14:43,839
...I will light the dead fire again!

115
00:14:43,960 --> 00:14:50,959
Long live Imren Tegin! Long live
Imren Tegin! Long live Imren Tegin!

116
00:15:18,800 --> 00:15:22,439
This is the blood of Turk.

117
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:30,119
This is the blood of Byzantine.
Two kins, two powers.

118
00:15:31,080 --> 00:15:36,599
Now I'm asking you. Are you
ready to be my blood fellow...

119
00:15:37,080 --> 00:15:42,279
...for my cause in my path?

120
00:15:42,400 --> 00:15:45,159
We are ready! We are ready!

121
00:15:45,240 --> 00:15:46,919
What do you say about victory?

122
00:15:47,040 --> 00:15:53,999
We swear it shall be ours!
We swear it shall be ours!

123
00:15:54,080 --> 00:15:56,959
And I swear to you..

124
00:15:57,320 --> 00:16:01,279
I will start my reign with the
blood I shed in these lands!

125
00:16:01,560 --> 00:16:05,679
Now light my victory fire all around!

126
00:16:06,080 --> 00:16:07,999
Destroy all the caravans!

127
00:16:08,120 --> 00:16:12,279
Osman won't be able to trade with anyone anymore!

128
00:16:12,440 --> 00:16:17,559
When he stops collecting gold, he
won't be able to even feed his alps!

129
00:16:17,920 --> 00:16:22,239
Benjamin, destroy everyone on your way.

130
00:16:22,560 --> 00:16:25,799
Show no mercy. Daniel.

131
00:16:27,440 --> 00:16:31,119
Go to Yenisehir and see Olivia.

132
00:16:31,400 --> 00:16:35,999
Elcim Hatun is going to die. That
marriage is never going to happen.

133
00:16:46,560 --> 00:16:48,879
Did you check the rugs and goods well, Gulce?

134
00:16:49,040 --> 00:16:51,079
We shouldn't take flawy goods to Yenisehir market.

135
00:16:51,320 --> 00:16:54,559
All checked one by one, my
Hatun. I separated the flawy ones.

136
00:16:54,680 --> 00:16:59,919
Good. Good. Go inform the
sisters and alps. We're leaving soon.

137
00:17:00,160 --> 00:17:02,799
As you order, Gonca Hatun.

138
00:17:05,118 --> 00:17:08,279
The hostility between you and Osman Bey is over.

139
00:17:08,598 --> 00:17:14,318
He let you go back to your family.
What do you think, Cerkutay?

140
00:17:17,440 --> 00:17:21,637
If my son and wife weren't there...

141
00:17:25,400 --> 00:17:28,759
I want to go there if you let me, my Shahzade.

142
00:17:30,080 --> 00:17:32,279
Are you sure, Cerkutay?

143
00:17:32,520 --> 00:17:36,559
After what happened, neither Osman
nor the alps will stop annoying you.

144
00:17:36,720 --> 00:17:39,199
They will treat you like dirt.

145
00:17:40,720 --> 00:17:43,679
I know about the possible troubles.

146
00:17:45,160 --> 00:17:51,519
But my son and
wife... I have to go.

147
00:17:53,000 --> 00:17:57,679
Alright then. Go back to your family, Cerkutay Bey.

148
00:17:58,520 --> 00:18:03,799
But take my sister to Yenisehir first.
Then you can go meet your family.

149
00:18:08,200 --> 00:18:11,519
Thank you, my Shahzade.

150
00:18:25,200 --> 00:18:30,039
It's good that Cerkutay has
left. I've never trusted him.

151
00:18:31,040 --> 00:18:34,879
Someone betraying Osman
might betray me one day as well.

152
00:18:35,000 --> 00:18:38,319
You're right, my Shahzade.

153
00:18:38,840 --> 00:18:44,839
Look after Gonca, Kanyumaz. Go to Yenisehir
and come back as soon as possible.

154
00:18:44,960 --> 00:18:50,159
As you order, my Shahzade. And what will you do?

155
00:18:50,520 --> 00:18:55,159
I’ll go to Kutahya and discuss
what happened with my father.

156
00:18:56,120 --> 00:19:00,119
Osman is gaining more
power day by day in these lands.

157
00:19:00,800 --> 00:19:04,119
He's going to show me a way.

158
00:19:26,960 --> 00:19:31,879
Who are you? Say your name!

159
00:19:42,280 --> 00:19:47,119
I'm Imren Tegin who Olcaytu sent as the gift.

160
00:19:49,200 --> 00:19:51,999
Commander is awaiting you.

161
00:19:53,280 --> 00:19:57,359
-Only you.
-Get out of my sight!

162
00:19:57,560 --> 00:20:00,879
No trust, no agreement!

163
00:20:01,360 --> 00:20:06,199
If you want Osman's head, you'll do what I say!

164
00:20:29,800 --> 00:20:33,039
-This is it?
Yes, my Shahzade.

165
00:20:33,240 --> 00:20:36,359
Aide Abdul Kasim is in his tent.

166
00:20:36,960 --> 00:20:42,359
We'll advance silently and turn
this demon nest into a grave for them!

167
00:20:54,240 --> 00:20:56,679
-Hasan Alp.
-My Shahzade.

168
00:20:57,000 --> 00:21:00,159
You attack from the side
and take them down silently.

169
00:21:00,280 --> 00:21:02,319
-Oguz Alp.
-My Shahzade?

170
00:21:02,440 --> 00:21:04,559
You take the ones on the other side.

171
00:21:04,720 --> 00:21:09,159
Keep your eyes wide open. I
want no mistakes. Come on.

172
00:21:15,840 --> 00:21:18,799
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate.

173
00:22:51,680 --> 00:22:55,079
We're under attack!

174
00:23:02,480 --> 00:23:05,479
How is that possible? Attack!

175
00:23:29,560 --> 00:23:33,199
Where are you going before
we even talk, Abdul Kasim?

176
00:23:37,000 --> 00:23:39,199
Where were you going?

177
00:23:41,640 --> 00:23:46,319
-Abdul Kasim.
-You can't get anything from me.

178
00:23:46,760 --> 00:23:49,679
You will either speak here...

179
00:23:52,280 --> 00:23:55,039
...or deliver your life.

180
00:24:03,560 --> 00:24:07,239
Stop. Stop.

181
00:24:13,200 --> 00:24:17,399
Now tell me. What are Olcaytu
and Imren Tegin planning?

182
00:24:17,560 --> 00:24:20,199
-Speak.
-Stop. Stop.

183
00:24:20,360 --> 00:24:23,479
They made a deal to destroy Osman.

184
00:24:23,840 --> 00:24:28,799
Olcaytu gave him what he wanted.

185
00:24:30,600 --> 00:24:34,039
-Anything else?
-That's all I know.

186
00:24:34,800 --> 00:24:37,479
Speak!

187
00:24:38,800 --> 00:24:42,359
Olcaytu sent him gold.

188
00:24:42,720 --> 00:24:46,639
-For Osman's head.
-Where is it coming from?

189
00:24:47,000 --> 00:24:51,159
Konya. Through the mountain road.

190
00:24:51,520 --> 00:24:53,999
-Mountain road, Konya?
-Tomorrow.

191
00:24:57,400 --> 00:25:00,359
What else? What else?

192
00:25:00,600 --> 00:25:02,479
-Signs.
-What signs?

193
00:25:02,640 --> 00:25:05,559
-Signs.
-Signs of what?

194
00:25:05,840 --> 00:25:10,079
Sul... Sultan..

195
00:25:12,160 --> 00:25:17,279
You dog! You all will face the same fate.

196
00:25:20,080 --> 00:25:25,079
Gold, huh? We've learned that, my Shahzade.

197
00:25:26,400 --> 00:25:31,199
If Allah permits, my father
will learn the rest. Let's go.

198
00:26:49,880 --> 00:26:54,799
My Ulgen and Ghazi! I'm coming! Wait for me!

199
00:26:55,000 --> 00:26:56,999
Come on, horse! Come on!

200
00:26:57,120 --> 00:27:00,919
Let me meet my son, wife and family!

201
00:27:01,200 --> 00:27:04,359
The way seems so long to you, huh?

202
00:27:04,600 --> 00:27:07,359
Of course it does, Gonca Hatun!

203
00:27:07,520 --> 00:27:11,479
Time isn't ticking! Way isn't ending! But...

204
00:27:11,520 --> 00:27:13,719
Osman Bey has forgiven me.

205
00:27:13,840 --> 00:27:17,439
Even if this way led to China, I would go! Come on!

206
00:27:17,840 --> 00:27:20,039
Osman Bey has a huge heart.

207
00:27:20,160 --> 00:27:23,399
And there is place for everyone. And he's faithful.

208
00:27:23,560 --> 00:27:26,599
He even forgives people
who do things behind his back.

209
00:27:26,800 --> 00:27:28,759
Like he forgave me.

210
00:27:28,960 --> 00:27:33,839
My Bey's heart is as big as this world! But...

211
00:27:34,080 --> 00:27:37,439
...I don't know if there is any
place for me in that huge world.

212
00:27:37,520 --> 00:27:41,319
Well... It won't probably be as it used to be.

213
00:27:41,800 --> 00:27:45,479
You think it won't? He won't trust again?

214
00:27:45,920 --> 00:27:49,519
Would you trust, Gonca Hatun? Well...

215
00:27:49,680 --> 00:27:52,159
He's forgiven me. That's enough for me.

216
00:27:52,280 --> 00:27:57,479
I'll meet my wife and son
and that will make me happy.

217
00:27:57,800 --> 00:28:02,919
May Allah give you a child from
the man you love, Gonca Hatun.

218
00:28:03,240 --> 00:28:08,239
A child holding a sword or a pen.

219
00:28:09,200 --> 00:28:12,399
Come on, horse! Come on!

220
00:28:12,480 --> 00:28:18,959
Let me meet my wife and son!
Come on, faster! To Yenisehir!

221
00:28:19,200 --> 00:28:21,919
Come on! Allah!

222
00:28:23,880 --> 00:28:28,999
Oh... Not now. No, not now!

223
00:28:29,600 --> 00:28:35,999
Oh no. Now what? We have a long way to go.

224
00:28:40,480 --> 00:28:43,879
Ambush! Alps, ambush!

225
00:29:38,240 --> 00:29:40,359
-Are you alright?
-Yes, you?

226
00:29:40,360 --> 00:29:42,399
I'm good.

227
00:30:16,440 --> 00:30:19,479
Kanyumaz, go after those dogs!

228
00:30:19,520 --> 00:30:23,519
-Find out who is holding their leashes!
-As you order, Gonca Hatun.

229
00:30:26,760 --> 00:30:29,039
-Are you alright?
-Yes. You?

230
00:30:29,160 --> 00:30:31,239
I'm alright. Fine.

231
00:30:31,800 --> 00:30:34,519
-Alps.
-Yes, Alaaddin Bey?

232
00:30:34,560 --> 00:30:37,999
Go inform Mehmed Bey about
the attacks on the caravans.

233
00:30:38,040 --> 00:30:40,559
-As you order, my Shahzade.
-Alps, stop.

234
00:30:40,760 --> 00:30:46,039
-My brother isn't here. He's gone to Kutahya.
-Then you're alone, huh?

235
00:30:47,560 --> 00:30:50,879
Stay among the women in
Yenisehir until Mehmed Bey is back.

236
00:30:51,080 --> 00:30:54,199
Don't go back. This spot is closer to Yenisehir.

237
00:30:54,240 --> 00:30:58,199
No need. We can take care
of ourselves, Alaaddin Bey.

238
00:30:58,360 --> 00:31:00,639
You mind your own matter.

239
00:31:03,640 --> 00:31:06,479
How sullen she is!

240
00:31:09,040 --> 00:31:10,999
Allah is eternal!

241
00:31:15,480 --> 00:31:17,759
Come on.

242
00:31:21,920 --> 00:31:25,199
Give me my trust back, Alaeddin Bey.

243
00:31:25,760 --> 00:31:29,999
It's not your trust. This
dagger is mine, did you forget?

244
00:31:30,200 --> 00:31:33,919
How long has the dagger you returned been yours?

245
00:31:34,880 --> 00:31:39,119
I won't give it to you. I won't
give this dagger to anyone.

246
00:31:40,240 --> 00:31:45,039
This is the gift of the woman I love.

247
00:31:45,760 --> 00:31:48,439
You gave up on that love,
Alaeddin. Give me my dagger.

248
00:31:48,520 --> 00:31:50,839
I won't give it to you, Gonca. -Give it to me.

249
00:31:50,880 --> 00:31:54,839
-I won't...
Give it to me!

250
00:31:55,000 --> 00:31:59,279
We must go now. My son is waiting.

251
00:32:00,200 --> 00:32:06,239
Cerkutay Bey. Your arm is alright, right?
Ghazi Alp will get happy when he sees you.

252
00:32:06,400 --> 00:32:09,359
It's alright, my Shahzade, thanks to you.

253
00:32:09,480 --> 00:32:12,799
He will get happy, but...

254
00:32:12,960 --> 00:32:15,319
...children call Ghazi "son of a spy".

255
00:32:15,560 --> 00:32:19,719
I don't know how we are going to silence them.

256
00:32:20,120 --> 00:32:23,279
They don't know, Cerkutay Bey. They don't know.

257
00:32:24,520 --> 00:32:27,159
No one knows what others feel.

258
00:32:30,880 --> 00:32:34,879
The cart is ready. We can set out, my Shahzade.

259
00:32:35,000 --> 00:32:39,559
Good. Let's go then. Coy Hatun, come.

260
00:32:39,720 --> 00:32:42,719
I guess you were going to call me Spy Hatun.

261
00:32:43,360 --> 00:32:48,159
No... I was going to call you Thief Hatun.

262
00:32:50,520 --> 00:32:53,079
A thief who steals hearts.

263
00:32:53,600 --> 00:33:01,359
Visit turkision.com for more!

264
00:33:43,600 --> 00:33:47,719
Olcaytu Khan cannot kill the executioner, right?

265
00:33:47,920 --> 00:33:50,719
Let's drink then.

266
00:33:57,320 --> 00:34:00,159
If you fail after all these demands...

267
00:34:00,360 --> 00:34:02,679
...Olcaytu will kill you, Imren Tegin.

268
00:34:02,880 --> 00:34:09,039
Don't worry... I will bring Osman's head to you.

269
00:34:09,760 --> 00:34:11,918
Now..

270
00:34:13,719 --> 00:34:19,599
Bring me my gifts. I need them...

271
00:34:19,960 --> 00:34:23,879
...for Osman's head.
What's the rush for?

272
00:34:24,000 --> 00:34:29,197
We will give you all the power you need.
-Then what?

273
00:34:29,600 --> 00:34:34,438
How am I going to trust Olcaytu?
-Are you saying that?

274
00:34:34,760 --> 00:34:39,119
Weren't you the one who allied
Vatican, the Papal knights...

275
00:34:39,480 --> 00:34:41,958
...criminals, and fugitives...

276
00:34:42,080 --> 00:34:48,239
...the Crusaders with the Ilkhanids?

277
00:34:51,960 --> 00:34:57,079
That's right. I'm not the one who should be scared.

278
00:34:57,400 --> 00:35:02,799
Osman is. -Now listen carefully.

279
00:35:03,440 --> 00:35:07,959
When the Crusader army crosses
Osman's lands and reaches Konya...

280
00:35:08,120 --> 00:35:11,519
...you'll be Olcaytu's favorite.

281
00:35:11,640 --> 00:35:17,679
With this power, you'll strike
Osman. You'll take his lands.

282
00:35:17,920 --> 00:35:21,279
As the grandson of Kay Kavus, the heir...

283
00:35:21,400 --> 00:35:24,799
...you'll establish your state...

284
00:35:25,800 --> 00:35:29,319
...with the trusts of the Seljuk dynasty.

285
00:35:34,280 --> 00:35:37,039
And with those trusts..

286
00:35:37,760 --> 00:35:40,519
...I'll receive the support of...

287
00:35:40,840 --> 00:35:46,119
...Osman's tribes, won't I?
Olcaytu allows you because of that.

288
00:35:46,240 --> 00:35:48,559
With one condition..

289
00:35:49,880 --> 00:35:55,279
...a state loyal to the Ilkhanids.
Is anything else possible in this world, Imren?

290
00:35:56,960 --> 00:36:00,879
I will use my power within Byzantium...

291
00:36:01,040 --> 00:36:03,519
...to conquer their lands.

292
00:36:03,680 --> 00:36:08,279
When Olcaytu finishes the Eastern
war, he'll turn his route to the West.

293
00:36:08,400 --> 00:36:13,279
That's when your lands will be our headquarters.

294
00:36:17,240 --> 00:36:22,279
Bring the trusts, let's see...

295
00:36:22,600 --> 00:36:25,479
...the Seljuk trusts.

296
00:36:25,600 --> 00:36:29,679
Not yet, not yet.

297
00:36:41,040 --> 00:36:43,759
Welcome.

298
00:36:45,480 --> 00:36:49,359
How is Gunduz Bey? Alps said he was injured.

299
00:36:49,560 --> 00:36:52,879
Gunduz Bey is alright, but...

300
00:36:53,080 --> 00:36:56,239
..I have different news for you.

301
00:36:56,360 --> 00:36:58,839
What is it?

302
00:37:00,440 --> 00:37:06,279
Good news first.
-Don't keep me guessing, tell me!

303
00:37:08,160 --> 00:37:11,679
What do you want the most, Malhun?

304
00:37:13,880 --> 00:37:15,599
A daughter-in-law, right?

305
00:37:15,880 --> 00:37:19,519
But Turkmen daughter-in-law, Bala mother.

306
00:37:20,400 --> 00:37:23,159
And she...

307
00:37:25,320 --> 00:37:29,119
...also wants her to be Muslim.

308
00:37:35,440 --> 00:37:38,119
Will my Orhan..

309
00:37:38,440 --> 00:37:40,999
Prepare the dowery, Malhun Hatun.

310
00:37:41,120 --> 00:37:44,399
Orhan accepted marrying Elcim.

311
00:37:48,480 --> 00:37:55,839
I knew it... I knew Orhan would make
the best decision, thanks to my Allah.

312
00:38:04,000 --> 00:38:08,639
May it be blessed, my daughter. I am glad.
-Thank you, Malhun Hatun.

313
00:38:08,960 --> 00:38:14,359
Tomorrow morning when Gunduz Bey arrives
they said we'll do as our customs order us...

314
00:38:14,920 --> 00:38:18,439
...and ask for the girl's hand in marriage.

315
00:38:18,720 --> 00:38:22,199
Then let's quickly start preparations.

316
00:38:22,640 --> 00:38:24,999
We have a lot to do, come on.

317
00:38:37,920 --> 00:38:42,479
My Fatma. What are you worried about?

318
00:38:43,040 --> 00:38:45,719
I am worried about my brother, Ulgen sister.

319
00:38:45,920 --> 00:38:49,599
Doesn't Shahzade Orhan love Holofira?

320
00:38:49,880 --> 00:38:54,239
What will happen to Holofira now?
Allah Allah... Why do you care about Holofira?

321
00:38:54,240 --> 00:38:56,839
He's interfering in the issues
of adults with the height of a leg.

322
00:38:56,840 --> 00:39:00,119
Good! I hope they find another
Hatun for that long Shahzade...

323
00:39:00,240 --> 00:39:03,839
...so I can marry Gonca.
Sure, sure, you can marry Gonca, Ghazi.

324
00:39:04,960 --> 00:39:08,319
How do you manage to talk
about Gonca every time, Ghazi?

325
00:39:08,560 --> 00:39:12,399
I am telling you! Because I love her!

326
00:39:14,200 --> 00:39:16,319
Give me patience, my Allah!

327
00:39:45,640 --> 00:39:48,759
You will signify your loyalty...

328
00:39:48,920 --> 00:39:53,119
...and stamp your seal.
Never without seeing the trusts.

329
00:39:54,480 --> 00:39:57,599
You never compromise.

330
00:39:58,720 --> 00:40:01,439
Bring them!

331
00:40:46,880 --> 00:40:52,439
Sultan Alaeddin Keykubat's ring.

332
00:40:55,680 --> 00:40:58,319
I see.

333
00:41:02,880 --> 00:41:06,799
So you had these all this time, huh?

334
00:41:34,760 --> 00:41:38,279
The proof of your allegiance.

335
00:41:47,560 --> 00:41:52,079
Don't make a mistake, Imren. Don't.

336
00:41:52,640 --> 00:41:58,279
Stamp your seal, so the
lands you step on will be yours.

337
00:41:58,600 --> 00:42:01,919
There is an issue, Commander.

338
00:42:02,040 --> 00:42:06,639
These lands are already mine.

339
00:42:07,920 --> 00:42:13,479
In my lands, we seal the agreements with blood.

340
00:42:50,080 --> 00:42:55,119
Take them! Take them!

341
00:42:58,320 --> 00:43:04,679
We will wait for our prey, for Imren.

342
00:43:11,040 --> 00:43:14,079
I don't want to cast a shadow
on your happiness Malhun, but...

343
00:43:14,240 --> 00:43:17,759
...we have an issue.
I know Bala, I know.

344
00:43:18,120 --> 00:43:20,959
Holofira and Olivia, right?

345
00:43:21,120 --> 00:43:25,639
Osman Bey thinks there are passages which
Imren uses to get in and leave Atranos.

346
00:43:25,880 --> 00:43:28,239
What are you saying?

347
00:43:28,480 --> 00:43:31,919
Then Olivia knows..
-Now our duty...

348
00:43:32,040 --> 00:43:36,599
...is to make Olivia speak and
learn more about those passages.

349
00:43:39,320 --> 00:43:43,239
Andra... What happened? Did something happen?
-My Hanim..

350
00:43:43,400 --> 00:43:46,279
Orhan Bey...

351
00:43:48,760 --> 00:43:52,559
...will marry Elcim Hatun.

352
00:44:05,600 --> 00:44:11,199
Don't worry, this is the last tear I shed.

353
00:44:14,360 --> 00:44:19,079
Orhan is a Shahzade. He has
to think about his Beylic's future.

354
00:44:19,600 --> 00:44:27,119
Holofira what are you saying? Orhan loves you!
And you love him! How can you accept this?

355
00:44:27,520 --> 00:44:33,919
Orhan is doing the right
thing. He is walking on a way.

356
00:44:35,000 --> 00:44:39,159
Our love can't be more important
than the future of his people.

357
00:44:39,280 --> 00:44:42,799
What about us? What about our people?

358
00:44:43,240 --> 00:44:47,439
You have to marry Orhan to take our castle
back! Or else, we will lose everything!

359
00:44:47,640 --> 00:44:52,839
Will you still give up on Orhan?

360
00:45:08,120 --> 00:45:11,839
-Tell me your name.
-Imren Tegin.

361
00:45:12,320 --> 00:45:15,439
Here.

362
00:46:08,320 --> 00:46:10,319
Welcome, Executioner.

363
00:46:19,120 --> 00:46:23,759
Konur.
He is my executioner.

364
00:46:36,080 --> 00:46:41,519
You figured things out again,
Osman. You came here before me.

365
00:46:41,840 --> 00:46:45,439
However, I will take what is mine.

366
00:46:45,920 --> 00:46:49,519
With Allah's permission,
we will take your life today.

367
00:46:49,840 --> 00:46:53,479
You still think of me like one of your enemies.

368
00:46:53,600 --> 00:46:58,159
I am the only person that can kill you.

369
00:46:58,360 --> 00:47:01,879
May everyone be my witness..

370
00:47:02,080 --> 00:47:08,239
..that you can not take my life. Alps!

371
00:47:42,160 --> 00:47:44,759
My treasures..

372
00:47:47,720 --> 00:47:53,119
-Two executioners are a lot for these lands.
-Right, one of us has to go.

373
00:48:42,400 --> 00:48:48,839
You will be buried to these
lands that you poisoned before!

374
00:49:15,440 --> 00:49:19,719
I will take it if I said so, Osman.

375
00:49:41,000 --> 00:49:43,679
Where are you?

376
00:50:03,200 --> 00:50:06,879
First, one of you. Then, all of you.

377
00:50:07,160 --> 00:50:10,679
I will bury all of you into these lands!

378
00:50:23,880 --> 00:50:30,999
Olivia. The information you
gave was true, thank you.

379
00:50:31,360 --> 00:50:34,319
I hope I earned your trust.

380
00:50:34,520 --> 00:50:37,359
As we are still locked in our rooms, Bala Hatun.

381
00:50:37,520 --> 00:50:41,319
No. Trust is not earned so easily, Olivia.

382
00:50:41,720 --> 00:50:46,519
If you are true with your intentions..

383
00:50:46,720 --> 00:50:51,639
..you will tell us about the
secret passages of Atranos.

384
00:50:52,000 --> 00:50:55,479
-Secret passages?
-Why are you surprised?

385
00:50:55,800 --> 00:51:00,519
Don't you know about the secret
passages under your castle?

386
00:51:01,080 --> 00:51:04,839
Or were you playing tricks from the start?

387
00:51:04,960 --> 00:51:08,519
Olivia? Why did you come to this palace?

388
00:51:08,640 --> 00:51:12,479
We told you many times, Malhun Hatun.

389
00:51:12,640 --> 00:51:16,999
There is no trickery. We
are after saving our lives.

390
00:51:17,040 --> 00:51:20,079
If there is no trickery, then
where are the secret passages?

391
00:51:20,320 --> 00:51:24,599
My people, my tribe is in danger. If
your intentions are true, then tell us.

392
00:51:24,840 --> 00:51:27,799
There is no secret passage that we know of.

393
00:51:28,120 --> 00:51:31,999
Old passages crumbled down years ago.

394
00:51:32,160 --> 00:51:35,359
You are lying right into our faces.

395
00:51:35,480 --> 00:51:39,439
However, we know you well.
You must've dug out a tunnel..

396
00:51:39,560 --> 00:51:42,359
..to run away while your castle is under siege.

397
00:51:42,480 --> 00:51:46,879
Enough. How many times do we have to tell?

398
00:51:47,840 --> 00:51:53,439
If you do not believe us,
take our lives or let us go.

399
00:51:56,760 --> 00:51:59,439
Your lives are entrusted to us, Holofira.

400
00:51:59,560 --> 00:52:02,919
Our intention is to learn the truth.

401
00:52:03,560 --> 00:52:06,279
Bala Hatun, yes..

402
00:52:06,480 --> 00:52:10,399
..we used to have secret
passages just like every other castle.

403
00:52:10,560 --> 00:52:14,439
However, these passages crumbled down years ago.

404
00:52:15,160 --> 00:52:17,839
After that, all exits were sealed.

405
00:52:17,960 --> 00:52:23,959
How did Imren got out if there are no
secret passages, then it must be open again.

406
00:52:24,120 --> 00:52:29,199
It is impossible. Even if Imren
Tegin finds out about their location..

407
00:52:29,360 --> 00:52:33,399
..there is no way for him to open
them up again in such a short time.

408
00:52:36,480 --> 00:52:39,519
However, it does not matter what we say.

409
00:52:40,800 --> 00:52:43,319
From what I can see, you will not believe us.

410
00:52:43,440 --> 00:52:46,959
If you were in my stead,
would you believe it Holofira?

411
00:52:47,120 --> 00:52:51,079
Bayindir Bey and our alps died
while you were in that castle.

412
00:52:51,200 --> 00:52:53,679
How can I believe you now?

413
00:52:54,200 --> 00:52:57,679
There is no need to say more.

414
00:52:58,040 --> 00:53:01,319
Come on, aunt.

415
00:53:34,320 --> 00:53:38,279
Osman. You play many tricks..

416
00:53:38,400 --> 00:53:44,599
..and think that you would fool me. You idiot.

417
00:53:52,760 --> 00:53:56,679
I was waiting for this moment for years.

418
00:53:58,800 --> 00:54:01,559
I always dreamt about this moment.

419
00:54:18,440 --> 00:54:24,279
Finally, my dreams are in my hands.

420
00:54:42,480 --> 00:54:46,439
-What is it?
-How can this be?

421
00:54:56,400 --> 00:55:06,479
Osman!

422
00:55:31,520 --> 00:55:35,439
Even I couldn't hold him, the
precaution you took saved me, my Bey.

423
00:55:37,120 --> 00:55:39,999
I could not hold him either. My Bey..

424
00:55:40,120 --> 00:55:44,079
-..this dog turned out to be tough.
I haven't seen someone fight like this.

425
00:55:44,320 --> 00:55:47,399
He escaped from us with a single move.

426
00:55:47,720 --> 00:55:53,119
My Bey, this Seljuks Sultan
signs, will add to our power, right?

427
00:55:53,240 --> 00:55:57,119
Of course it will, brother.
We've gained a great victory.

428
00:55:57,320 --> 00:56:03,559
Thank Allah.
Thank Allah who granted us this day.

429
00:56:04,480 --> 00:56:07,999
These are the last remains
of Turk's glorious state.

430
00:56:08,320 --> 00:56:12,199
They were using these as a trump card for so long.

431
00:56:12,320 --> 00:56:14,759
This is the sword of Grand Keykubad.

432
00:56:14,880 --> 00:56:18,479
This was not forged to be
left in hands of the enemy.

433
00:56:19,040 --> 00:56:23,839
Now, put them away for now.

434
00:56:27,680 --> 00:56:33,759
This Imren Tegin said this fight
would not be over before one of us dies.

435
00:56:33,880 --> 00:56:39,119
Then, we want his head, not these treasures.

436
00:56:39,520 --> 00:56:43,119
As long as he lives, Rome would revive..

437
00:56:43,600 --> 00:56:47,039
..and there would be disorder
among Turks. That is why..

438
00:56:47,160 --> 00:56:50,959
-..we will kill that dog.
What will do with these, my Bey?

439
00:56:53,360 --> 00:56:58,399
The sky can only have one sun.

440
00:56:58,520 --> 00:57:03,399
I know what we will do. Come on then.

441
00:57:15,360 --> 00:57:18,199
Alaeddin Bey.

442
00:57:19,240 --> 00:57:22,759
I don't want to stay at the palace. Let me go.

443
00:57:23,680 --> 00:57:26,879
Are you afraid of my mother and father?

444
00:57:27,920 --> 00:57:30,239
They have forgiven you.

445
00:57:30,840 --> 00:57:35,919
Why don't you forgive me..

446
00:57:36,040 --> 00:57:39,679
..and we will stay here?
-Alaeddin Bey.

447
00:57:40,040 --> 00:57:45,319
What you say is not so easy. Do not dream about it.

448
00:57:47,200 --> 00:57:51,279
So you will make it hard, Coy Hatun.

449
00:57:51,520 --> 00:57:55,359
Alright then. Make it hard, it is your right.

450
00:57:56,000 --> 00:58:00,199
Say whatever you want, do whatever
you want, I won't say anything.

451
00:58:00,320 --> 00:58:05,559
However, forgive me.

452
00:58:08,560 --> 00:58:11,719
My son.

453
00:58:12,800 --> 00:58:15,999
-Gonca.
-Mother?

454
00:58:16,120 --> 00:58:19,159
-Are you alright?
-We are alright, mother.

455
00:58:19,280 --> 00:58:23,639
Just as we thought, Imren's
men attacked the caravan.

456
00:58:27,760 --> 00:58:32,279
-Are you alright, my daughter?
-I am alright, Bala Hatun.

457
00:58:32,800 --> 00:58:37,239
Mehmed Bey went to Kutahya.

458
00:58:37,440 --> 00:58:40,159
I did not want them to return
to the Frontier Marketplace.

459
00:58:40,680 --> 00:58:45,999
However, Gonca Hatun still
does not want to stay, mother.

460
00:58:51,240 --> 00:58:56,279
Gonca. You heard Osman Bey, right?

461
00:58:57,360 --> 00:59:00,359
The past is in the past.

462
00:59:00,640 --> 00:59:07,319
Do not feel bad. This is your home also, come on.

463
00:59:08,920 --> 00:59:11,919
Thank you, Bala Hatun.

464
00:59:24,680 --> 00:59:28,519
Kismet, prepare a room for Gonca.

465
00:59:28,840 --> 00:59:32,839
And keep your eyes open.

466
00:59:34,280 --> 00:59:37,479
Don't you trust Gonca Hatun, my Hatun?

467
00:59:38,200 --> 00:59:41,799
She's a good girl, did things for her family.

468
00:59:42,120 --> 00:59:46,519
But she made a mistake once, Kismet.

469
00:59:46,920 --> 00:59:50,119
And this is about my son.

470
00:59:51,680 --> 00:59:54,999
You got this.

471
00:59:59,120 --> 01:00:02,279
Mother, I'm telling you I heard Gonca Hatun.

472
01:00:02,280 --> 01:00:06,599
-Just let me go.
-Hey. Look at me.

473
01:00:06,920 --> 01:00:11,519
Don't go crazy when you see
her. Stop bothering her, Ghazi.

474
01:00:15,760 --> 01:00:18,639
Shh... Get behind me.

475
01:00:20,200 --> 01:00:24,639
-Mother, let me go first.
-Hey, come here. Get back.

476
01:00:26,920 --> 01:00:29,199
Stay here.

477
01:00:30,680 --> 01:00:34,279
Ghazi, your father is here...

478
01:00:34,520 --> 01:00:37,159
Cerkutay! Cerkutay!

479
01:00:37,400 --> 01:00:40,679
-Cerkutay!
Did you kill my father?

480
01:00:40,720 --> 01:00:43,479
-Cerkutay, wake up.
-Father!

481
01:00:43,520 --> 01:00:46,719
-Cerkutay.
-Father.

482
01:00:48,480 --> 01:00:53,679
-Cerkutay? What are you doing?
-Who are you?

483
01:00:57,560 --> 01:01:00,479
-What is this place?
-What?

484
01:01:00,880 --> 01:01:06,319
What do you mean? I'm Ulgen,
your hatun. This is your son Ghazi.

485
01:01:15,960 --> 01:01:19,319
-Osman Bey...
-Mother.

486
01:01:19,720 --> 01:01:24,479
My father thinks I'm Osman Bey.
Luckily, he remembers Osman Bey but...

487
01:01:24,680 --> 01:01:29,159
-He doesn't remember us.
-I just hit him and he lost his mind.

488
01:01:29,960 --> 01:01:33,479
Father, this is us! Don't you remember?

489
01:01:37,200 --> 01:01:39,839
Your father would never forget you!

490
01:01:40,040 --> 01:01:42,399
My boy! Your father is back!

491
01:01:42,440 --> 01:01:46,519
-Just for you, Ghazi!
-My father! He remembers me!

492
01:01:46,800 --> 01:01:50,199
I would never forget you,
boy. We are back together!

493
01:01:50,240 --> 01:01:53,159
We will never be separated again!

494
01:02:00,640 --> 01:02:04,959
I have a little question. You remember me?

495
01:02:11,040 --> 01:02:13,799
Cerkutay...

496
01:02:16,040 --> 01:02:20,359
Look at me. If you say you don't hear me...

497
01:02:20,360 --> 01:02:22,679
..or don't remember me

498
01:02:22,680 --> 01:02:26,079
...I will just break your head!

499
01:02:28,600 --> 01:02:31,999
I would never forget you, my Hatun.

500
01:02:32,560 --> 01:02:35,719
-You serious?
-Yes.

501
01:02:39,400 --> 01:02:46,239
Look around well. You'll bring
things here from now on. Alright?

502
01:02:48,760 --> 01:02:52,479
I'm glad you're here.

503
01:02:53,440 --> 01:02:56,119
You and I will get along well.

504
01:02:57,200 --> 01:03:00,519
But we need to find a name for you.

505
01:03:00,720 --> 01:03:04,519
If you can't hear or speak,

506
01:03:05,160 --> 01:03:08,039
...your name shall be Mute.

507
01:03:14,760 --> 01:03:19,399
They are beautiful! The
fabric I've been looking for!

508
01:03:51,800 --> 01:03:55,999
Were there any spies among the
warriors? You're supposed to spy.

509
01:03:57,000 --> 01:04:01,599
We thought Osman's alps killed
you. What are you doing here?

510
01:04:01,880 --> 01:04:05,039
I came here as a prisoner
and entered Osman's palace.

511
01:04:05,200 --> 01:04:08,439
They think I can't speak or
hear. They feel pity for me.

512
01:04:08,760 --> 01:04:12,879
Good. Good. Their mercy will bring their end.

513
01:04:18,120 --> 01:04:20,839
Here.

514
01:04:21,960 --> 01:04:25,879
I was going to give this to Olivia.
But you can deliver it more easily.

515
01:04:28,880 --> 01:04:32,479
Listen well. With Imren Tegin's orders.

516
01:04:32,600 --> 01:04:35,879
You need to poison Elcim.

517
01:04:48,880 --> 01:04:55,319
Where has she gone? She doesn't know around! Mute!

518
01:05:00,920 --> 01:05:02,919
Mute!

519
01:05:08,160 --> 01:05:14,959
Mute! Stay with me. Or you may get lost.

520
01:05:15,960 --> 01:05:19,719
Let's go to the palace!

521
01:05:47,360 --> 01:05:50,439
I didn't believe any of your words.

522
01:05:52,280 --> 01:05:55,799
I have no intention to make you believe.

523
01:05:56,480 --> 01:06:00,359
Imren killed all the lords...

524
01:06:01,240 --> 01:06:03,378
Why did he leave
your aunt alive?

525
01:06:03,390 --> 01:06:05,479
My aunt didn't
accept his wishes.

526
01:06:05,720 --> 01:06:09,079
Now we are here because he wants to kill her.

527
01:06:09,240 --> 01:06:14,999
-I care about my tribe and people.
If you know about the passages... -Look.

528
01:06:21,800 --> 01:06:24,639
You don't know me.

529
01:06:24,920 --> 01:06:28,479
If I knew where those passages were...

530
01:06:28,720 --> 01:06:32,319
...I would kill Imren and take my castle back...

531
01:06:32,440 --> 01:06:36,999
...not come here and take shelter.

532
01:06:37,720 --> 01:06:43,239
Good. For now, I believe you.

533
01:06:45,320 --> 01:06:49,537
I hope you can take your
castle back as soon as possible.

534
01:06:49,549 --> 01:06:50,959
Thank you.

535
01:06:55,600 --> 01:07:01,799
Look, Elcim. You see me as
your opponent, but you should not...

536
01:07:02,000 --> 01:07:05,559
I just want to get rid of Imren..

537
01:07:05,680 --> 01:07:07,719
...and go back to my castle.

538
01:07:09,840 --> 01:07:11,559
Now, if you allow me...

539
01:07:37,160 --> 01:07:39,959
Yunus Emre...

540
01:07:41,040 --> 01:07:44,519
-Peace be upon you.
-Peace be upon you too.

541
01:07:45,320 --> 01:07:51,839
Peace be upon you too. Thanks to Him,
Who united our ways. It's been a long time, huh?

542
01:07:57,480 --> 01:08:01,999
You're returning from one war and heading
into another, aren't you, Orhan Bey?

543
01:08:05,440 --> 01:08:09,999
I am going to the biggest one, Yunus Emre.

544
01:08:13,040 --> 01:08:18,759
I made an important decision
for the state. But my heart...

545
01:08:19,720 --> 01:08:25,879
...my heart is in flames. And I am
going to the palace now to face that fire.

546
01:08:26,240 --> 01:08:29,158
You chose hegira, huh?

547
01:08:29,800 --> 01:08:33,238
The Messenger of Allah...

548
01:08:33,359 --> 01:08:36,158
..loved the Kaaba so much.

549
01:08:36,640 --> 01:08:41,479
He resisted staying in Mecca
despite all the oppression and hardship.

550
01:08:41,680 --> 01:08:45,278
You know... But when it became...

551
01:08:45,439 --> 01:08:49,639
...impossible to teach the
Islamic cause in Mecca...

552
01:08:49,840 --> 01:08:54,439
...he migrated to Medina. He preferred to...

553
01:08:54,640 --> 01:08:58,278
...miss the Kaaba for the cause of Islam.

554
01:08:58,680 --> 01:09:02,278
And the cause of Islam grew in Medina.

555
01:09:02,439 --> 01:09:05,350
One of the most significant
events that contributed

556
01:09:05,363 --> 01:09:08,118
to the conversion of
the polytheists to Islam...

557
01:09:08,240 --> 01:09:10,799
...and the purification of Mecca from idols...

558
01:09:10,920 --> 01:09:14,999
...was the migration...

559
01:09:15,120 --> 01:09:18,759
...of The Messenger of Allah to Madinah.

560
01:09:18,920 --> 01:09:24,839
Now, it is your turn to migrate.

561
01:09:26,200 --> 01:09:30,599
I know your heart is burning.

562
01:09:31,240 --> 01:09:36,198
But that fire will lead to great
reward in the future, who knows?

563
01:09:36,399 --> 01:09:40,879
Because you prioritize the cause of Islam
over your heart's cause.

564
01:09:41,120 --> 01:09:43,759
Since it is our duty...

565
01:09:44,120 --> 01:09:48,759
...it is our obligation to do what is
necessary for the future of both Beylics.

566
01:09:48,880 --> 01:09:52,358
Even if a thousand hearts of mine turn to ashes...

567
01:09:52,960 --> 01:09:56,879
...for the sake of the world
of Islam, I will not be upset.

568
01:09:57,200 --> 01:10:00,519
I won't be sad, but...

569
01:10:08,200 --> 01:10:11,319
What about her?

570
01:10:12,720 --> 01:10:17,319
Everyone's deed book is
different. Everyone's test is different.

571
01:10:17,640 --> 01:10:21,319
The test is a means, an opportunity...

572
01:10:21,520 --> 01:10:25,279
...to guide a person to the right path.

573
01:10:25,720 --> 01:10:30,639
Each of us will see that test as a means...

574
01:10:30,880 --> 01:10:36,919
...to become an honest and
fair person. May Allah let us...

575
01:10:37,120 --> 01:10:42,439
...be victorious over the tests
that are heavy on our nafs.

576
01:10:42,720 --> 01:10:45,639
Aameen.

577
01:10:55,720 --> 01:10:58,759
O Allah...
In the name of Allah!

578
01:11:07,480 --> 01:11:11,839
Brother... The water has boiled. Give it to me.

579
01:11:13,360 --> 01:11:16,879
Allah..

580
01:11:19,960 --> 01:11:25,919
Brother... What is this?
Alps will eat this, not horses!

581
01:11:26,640 --> 01:11:30,879
That's the best I can do with a dagger, brother.

582
01:11:31,200 --> 01:11:35,759
If Cerkutay Bey was here, he would chop them well.

583
01:11:36,040 --> 01:11:39,999
Nevermind, Alps. We can still eat them, right?

584
01:11:40,520 --> 01:11:44,599
Konur Bey... My Bey will also
eat this, that's why I am asking.

585
01:11:45,240 --> 01:11:48,839
-Aykurt!
-My Bey.

586
01:11:50,560 --> 01:11:54,679
Did your Bey grow up in a palace, huh?

587
01:11:55,480 --> 01:12:02,199
We are used to such tables. Come on now... Come on.

588
01:12:05,400 --> 01:12:10,359
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate.

589
01:12:18,600 --> 01:12:21,439
My Bey... We have onions as well, you like them.

590
01:12:21,560 --> 01:12:24,319
Thank you, thank you

591
01:12:25,080 --> 01:12:30,359
-Here, my Bey.
-Thank you. Praise be.

592
01:12:31,080 --> 01:12:34,639
Praise be.

593
01:12:42,440 --> 01:12:46,279
My Bey. There is no trace of Imren Tegin.

594
01:12:50,520 --> 01:12:56,439
Don't worry. He will find us when his death comes.

595
01:12:57,280 --> 01:13:01,519
-Come on, go and eat.
-Yes my Bey.

596
01:13:09,160 --> 01:13:13,199
Oh praise be, what is this?

597
01:13:13,560 --> 01:13:16,479
-Aykurt!
-My Bey..

598
01:13:17,160 --> 01:13:20,319
Maybe you should become
a cook, not the Head of Alps.

599
01:13:23,160 --> 01:13:26,639
Don't,my Bey. Do not separate me and my sword.

600
01:13:32,520 --> 01:13:39,679
Don't my Bey, your Head of
Alps is talented, but I need him.

601
01:13:43,040 --> 01:13:47,519
If that's what you are saying...

602
01:13:47,680 --> 01:13:51,679
...then from now on, you will cook the meals!

603
01:13:56,000 --> 01:14:01,319
Please, don't my Bey. Still, we will do as you say.

604
01:14:04,360 --> 01:14:07,439
-Bring me the trusts.
-Yes my Bey.

605
01:14:21,200 --> 01:14:24,879
Elcim... Can I come in, my daughter?

606
01:14:25,160 --> 01:14:28,639
Sure, Malhun Hatun.

607
01:14:33,120 --> 01:14:37,159
We will ask for your hand tomorrow, I
wanted to check if something's missing.

608
01:14:37,280 --> 01:14:42,319
Thank you, Malhun Hatun. You hold
me in high regard. I have everything.

609
01:14:42,440 --> 01:14:45,559
We are doing our duty, my daughter.

610
01:14:45,680 --> 01:14:49,359
Tomorrow, with Allah's
consent, we will give this a name.

611
01:14:49,480 --> 01:14:54,799
I have known you well, and I
believe you will be worthy of my Orhan.

612
01:14:55,000 --> 01:14:59,199
But the way you will walk on
will not be a garden of roses.

613
01:14:59,560 --> 01:15:02,697
You will struggle with many
tests, you know that right?

614
01:15:02,709 --> 01:15:03,759
I do.

615
01:15:04,320 --> 01:15:08,279
But this is more of a test for
Orhan Bey than it is for me.

616
01:15:09,680 --> 01:15:14,959
You are a smart girl, Elcim. I know
Holofira's presence here disturbs you.

617
01:15:15,160 --> 01:15:17,639
But this is the issue of the state.

618
01:15:17,840 --> 01:15:22,039
Sending back someone seeking
refuge wouldn't suit us, my daughter.

619
01:15:22,200 --> 01:15:26,799
Even if you call it the state's
issue, Orhan Bey loves Holofira.

620
01:15:27,080 --> 01:15:32,799
I know, I can see it. But I don't trust Holofira.

621
01:15:32,920 --> 01:15:38,199
I hope Orhan Bey will not show a weakness
which will prevent two Beylics from uniting.

622
01:15:38,360 --> 01:15:44,319
I gave up on myself. I just
care about Kayi's future.

623
01:15:52,760 --> 01:16:03,159
O, the Seljuk...

624
01:16:13,560 --> 01:16:19,119
My ancestor Alparslan opened
the path of gaza for us in Malazgirt...

625
01:16:19,560 --> 01:16:23,679
...with his blood and his sword...

626
01:16:25,880 --> 01:16:31,039
My grandfather Suleyman
Shah walked all the way to Iznik...

627
01:16:31,920 --> 01:16:37,519
He sent Crusaders back. He
even made Konya the capital city.

628
01:16:41,360 --> 01:16:47,479
He destroyed many crusaders and
turned many lands into our homeland.

629
01:16:55,120 --> 01:17:00,159
And Alaeddin Keykubat...

630
01:17:00,800 --> 01:17:04,679
The most powerful period of the Seljuk...

631
01:17:05,240 --> 01:17:09,439
...was during the reign of Alaeddin Keykubat.

632
01:17:09,680 --> 01:17:14,399
This empire, once considered invincible...

633
01:17:14,600 --> 01:17:19,199
...is now about to collapse.

634
01:17:21,400 --> 01:17:24,039
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate.

635
01:17:34,120 --> 01:17:40,079
Tell me, why? Why?

636
01:17:41,440 --> 01:17:46,399
Because they made many
mistakes. They fought for the throne.

637
01:17:46,520 --> 01:17:50,119
And they did not rule with justice.

638
01:17:50,560 --> 01:17:55,479
Thus... There were rebellions.
If Allah permits...

639
01:17:55,880 --> 01:18:01,079
-If Allah permits we won't make the same mistakes.
-If Allah permits, my Bey.

640
01:18:01,760 --> 01:18:06,719
We will never let them question our control.

641
01:18:06,960 --> 01:18:12,279
And we will first rule with justice.

642
01:18:13,160 --> 01:18:17,559
We will not make that mistake. We won't...

643
01:18:17,640 --> 01:18:21,399
...and our state will be everlasting.

644
01:18:23,960 --> 01:18:30,639
My Bey... Why are we burying these trusts
when we could gain strength with them?

645
01:18:31,040 --> 01:18:34,719
Our way and our cause are the same.

646
01:18:35,320 --> 01:18:40,159
But we won't rule with a trust..

647
01:18:41,040 --> 01:18:44,759
...we will rule with justice.

648
01:18:45,200 --> 01:18:51,079
And our swords will secure the justice.

649
01:18:52,400 --> 01:18:56,679
The one who stands in the
shadow does not cast a shadow.

650
01:18:57,080 --> 01:19:01,719
With Allah's consent, I hope,
we will spread our shadow everywhere.

651
01:19:01,960 --> 01:19:05,279
-If Allah permits my Bey.
-If Allah permits my Bey.

652
01:19:05,840 --> 01:19:08,719
If someone takes these trusts one day and...

653
01:19:08,920 --> 01:19:12,159
...says, "I am also one of the heirs"...

654
01:19:12,280 --> 01:19:15,719
...it will surely be difficult.

655
01:19:16,920 --> 01:19:20,079
Thus..

656
01:19:20,400 --> 01:19:24,799
...it is time to bury them in history.

657
01:19:45,840 --> 01:19:51,039
We will commemorate The State of Seljuks..

658
01:19:51,320 --> 01:19:55,199
..with its glories and legacies.

659
01:19:57,400 --> 01:20:00,519
Alright then.

660
01:20:02,200 --> 01:20:05,839
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate.

661
01:20:25,080 --> 01:20:29,959
Alps, seal the cave exit.

662
01:20:30,280 --> 01:20:37,639
This, if Allah permits, is the end of an era,
and the beginning of a new one.

663
01:20:41,120 --> 01:20:42,879
May Allah open our paths.

664
01:20:43,040 --> 01:20:48,399
-Ameen.
-Ameen, my Bey.

665
01:20:53,320 --> 01:20:59,359
So, from what I've heard,
Shahzade Orhan is getting married.

666
01:21:00,200 --> 01:21:03,679
Now it is that tall Shahzade's turn.

667
01:21:04,000 --> 01:21:08,239
You do not forgive the tall Shahzade, right?

668
01:21:08,520 --> 01:21:12,839
For real, Gonca will you not forgive my brother?

669
01:21:12,960 --> 01:21:17,359
Fatma Hatun, do not confuse Gonca Hatun.

670
01:21:17,600 --> 01:21:20,919
Shut it Gazi.

671
01:21:23,600 --> 01:21:28,719
Look here Gazi, I actually love you more.

672
01:21:28,920 --> 01:21:32,319
-Really?
-Really.

673
01:21:33,760 --> 01:21:38,599
However, you are just a kid. What can we do?

674
01:21:39,680 --> 01:21:42,239
Are we allowed, Gonca Hatun?

675
01:21:42,480 --> 01:21:45,399
No you are not, Shahzade!

676
01:21:48,000 --> 01:21:51,799
Gazi, come on Gazi.

677
01:21:55,680 --> 01:22:00,359
-We shall leave you to talk.
-I will come back Gonca Hatun!

678
01:22:00,520 --> 01:22:03,119
Don't you forgive tall Shahzade!

679
01:22:03,280 --> 01:22:05,479
Come on, move!

680
01:22:17,040 --> 01:22:21,039
So I have a fierce opponent, Trickster Hatun.

681
01:22:21,640 --> 01:22:26,959
-Gonca.
-Yes? What is it Alaeddin Bey?

682
01:22:28,120 --> 01:22:31,279
Gazelle-eyed Hatun.

683
01:22:32,640 --> 01:22:36,519
-Shall we speak now? -Of course.

684
01:22:37,440 --> 01:22:42,199
No medicine would close the wound I made, I know.

685
01:22:42,880 --> 01:22:46,959
They did not teach me how to tend to the wound..

686
01:22:47,280 --> 01:22:50,319
..a lover makes at the school.

687
01:22:51,560 --> 01:22:56,799
I made a mistake. However, I did not know.

688
01:22:57,800 --> 01:23:02,559
-What did you learn? -I learned everything.

689
01:23:04,680 --> 01:23:08,919
-Ulgen Hatun told me everything.
-Ulgen..

690
01:23:09,120 --> 01:23:12,559
Why you told me you don't love me.

691
01:23:13,800 --> 01:23:19,239
That you didn't do your duty, to not betray me..

692
01:23:20,240 --> 01:23:23,599
..that you given up on me.

693
01:23:25,720 --> 01:23:28,879
The blows you took..

694
01:23:29,960 --> 01:23:33,639
..I was not with you.

695
01:23:36,120 --> 01:23:40,839
You were correct. I left you alone.

696
01:23:42,240 --> 01:23:46,999
However, it is over now. Past is in the past.

697
01:23:47,520 --> 01:23:54,199
I swear to you, I will make you forget all the
trouble you had to endure because of me.

698
01:23:54,800 --> 01:23:59,959
What if you don't believe me again?
How can I trust you, Alaeddin?

699
01:24:01,840 --> 01:24:06,679
Besides everything, what about your family?

700
01:24:07,800 --> 01:24:11,519
How will they trust a Hatun
that is known for being a spy?

701
01:24:11,680 --> 01:24:15,839
Gonca. I promise to you..

702
01:24:16,000 --> 01:24:19,799
No matter what happens, no matter what they say..

703
01:24:20,200 --> 01:24:24,839
..I will always be your side.

704
01:24:25,520 --> 01:24:28,519
Did you forgive me?

705
01:24:30,520 --> 01:24:33,839
What difference would it make?

706
01:24:34,200 --> 01:24:38,799
Don't you know of my brother? And my mother?

707
01:24:39,360 --> 01:24:43,679
Alaeddin, don't you know of my mother? No..

708
01:24:43,960 --> 01:24:48,599
-..no Alaeddin it cannot happen.
-Don't say no.

709
01:24:50,240 --> 01:24:52,839
If you forgive me..

710
01:24:53,120 --> 01:24:58,679
..we have enough strength
to overcome every obstacle.

711
01:24:58,800 --> 01:25:02,199
That is what I fear the most.

712
01:25:02,440 --> 01:25:06,399
I am afraid of your bravery, Alaeddin.

713
01:25:06,680 --> 01:25:10,639
Look, I can't predict what my brother can do.

714
01:25:12,080 --> 01:25:15,039
This is a great issue.

715
01:25:15,960 --> 01:25:19,519
This would make Kayis and Germiyanids enemies.

716
01:25:20,160 --> 01:25:23,559
There will not be such a war.

717
01:25:23,960 --> 01:25:29,319
I am saying to you, I am ready
to face every obstacle with you.

718
01:25:30,320 --> 01:25:35,759
Tell me now. Forgive me.

719
01:25:44,560 --> 01:25:48,479
Alright, I forgive you.

720
01:25:48,760 --> 01:25:54,359
-Allah!
-Stop, I am still mad at you.

721
01:25:55,480 --> 01:26:01,119
Finally, thank Allah.
You forgive me.

722
01:26:05,640 --> 01:26:08,639
-My Gonca.
-Yes?

723
01:26:09,360 --> 01:26:13,799
-Now, free my name.
-No.

724
01:26:16,720 --> 01:26:19,599
There is still time for that.

725
01:26:23,720 --> 01:26:28,079
-My Gonca.
-I forgive you.

726
01:26:28,520 --> 01:26:34,159
-Leave now.
-I was thinking about a horse race..

727
01:26:34,480 --> 01:26:37,719
..would be good for you anger.

728
01:26:37,840 --> 01:26:41,199
Come on Alaeddin.

729
01:26:41,720 --> 01:26:46,639
-Come on, Alaeddin.
-My Gonca.

730
01:26:47,080 --> 01:26:52,759
-Come on now, Alaeddin Bey.
-My Gonca.

731
01:27:05,560 --> 01:27:09,359
Ulgen? Why would Malhun
Hatun call me to the kitchen?

732
01:27:09,480 --> 01:27:12,839
Is it because..
-It is..

733
01:27:13,160 --> 01:27:18,679
-..not Malhun Hatun who called you.
-It was not my mother who called you.

734
01:27:19,240 --> 01:27:22,999
It was me, Lord's daughter.

735
01:27:25,800 --> 01:27:30,679
-Orhan Bey.
-Holofira.

736
01:27:32,280 --> 01:27:35,639
Listen to me.

737
01:27:37,480 --> 01:27:41,199
What will we talk about?

738
01:27:42,760 --> 01:27:45,599
You learned everything.

739
01:27:46,240 --> 01:27:50,439
-I wanted you to hear from me first.
-It would've changed nothing.

740
01:27:50,640 --> 01:27:54,399
-You are doing what is right.
-Holofira, look.

741
01:27:54,600 --> 01:27:58,599
I've thought about it a lot.
However, I could not find a way.

742
01:27:58,840 --> 01:28:04,679
-For my State, for my family, I had to.
-I know your truth.

743
01:28:05,480 --> 01:28:09,039
No other thing would fit you anyway.

744
01:28:09,280 --> 01:28:12,479
However, I will never leave by your side, Holofira.

745
01:28:12,680 --> 01:28:16,319
I will never give up on you.

746
01:28:17,280 --> 01:28:25,159
What will you do? Will I be your
second wife like your mother?

747
01:28:26,200 --> 01:28:34,039
Alright. Let us say I accept,
you crushed my honor..

748
01:28:34,200 --> 01:28:39,879
..what about Elcim? Will she accept it?

749
01:28:40,560 --> 01:28:46,319
What about your mother? They do not trust me.

750
01:28:46,440 --> 01:28:49,879
They are looking for excuses to blame me.

751
01:28:50,120 --> 01:28:53,679
When we get married, will
they really take me to their side?

752
01:28:53,880 --> 01:28:58,159
Will they really trust me? No.

753
01:28:59,200 --> 01:29:03,359
I will still be the first one to blame.

754
01:29:03,480 --> 01:29:06,639
-Holofira, look..
-Elcim Hatun..

755
01:29:07,040 --> 01:29:14,519
..is both Turk and a muslim.
She is also from your blood.

756
01:29:15,520 --> 01:29:20,079
She is the right wife for you.

757
01:29:20,360 --> 01:29:24,239
There is no need to force anything.

758
01:29:24,400 --> 01:29:29,159
Holofira, do not do this. If you love me..

759
01:29:29,480 --> 01:29:33,119
..even a little bit, think about it a little more.

760
01:29:33,320 --> 01:29:37,599
I loved you a lot, Orhan Bey.

761
01:29:40,880 --> 01:29:43,159
However, it over now.

762
01:29:44,600 --> 01:29:50,119
Now, you will do everything for your State
and I will do everything for my castle.

763
01:29:52,240 --> 01:29:55,479
That is all.

764
01:30:18,720 --> 01:30:24,479
You are the woman I love,
and will always love, Holofira.

765
01:30:26,400 --> 01:30:29,479
Never forget this.

766
01:30:34,360 --> 01:30:37,279
I need to go now.

767
01:30:54,480 --> 01:30:56,959
Come in.

768
01:31:04,760 --> 01:31:07,639
I didn't want anything.

769
01:31:16,120 --> 01:31:19,919
But Imren Tegin wants something very important.

770
01:31:22,680 --> 01:31:25,759
Who are you?

771
01:31:28,840 --> 01:31:33,199
This is yours. We're on the same side.

772
01:31:40,040 --> 01:31:43,719
Imren Tegin wants us to poison Elcim.

773
01:31:44,960 --> 01:31:48,479
Your being here will make
things much easier for me.

774
01:31:57,840 --> 01:32:01,199
Pour this poison into Elcim's drink.

775
01:32:01,760 --> 01:32:04,519
But the blame will be put on Holofira.

776
01:32:05,040 --> 01:32:08,679
You don't even avoid risking your niece.

777
01:32:09,160 --> 01:32:14,959
This is the only way. Orhan will
rebel against his father for Holofira.

778
01:32:15,560 --> 01:32:19,119
And two Kayi Beys will fight each other.

779
01:32:19,560 --> 01:32:22,439
We'll destroy them by dividing.

780
01:32:24,760 --> 01:32:28,159
And Holofira will never suspect me.

781
01:32:28,720 --> 01:32:33,239
Because she thinks I want to collaborate
with Osman and take my castle back.

782
01:32:34,240 --> 01:32:36,919
I have many things to learn from you.

783
01:32:37,080 --> 01:32:39,599
Poison Elcim as soon as possible then.

784
01:32:39,920 --> 01:32:42,479
Because the real game will start afterwards.

785
01:32:42,760 --> 01:32:46,799
They'll kill Holofira when she's blamed.
You know that, right?

786
01:32:47,000 --> 01:32:49,959
Orhan will never let that happen.

787
01:32:50,240 --> 01:32:52,679
What if he fails?

788
01:32:53,120 --> 01:32:57,919
Holofira will be honored with
a blessed death for our lands.

789
01:33:01,840 --> 01:33:09,599
Visit turkision.com for more!

790
01:33:17,240 --> 01:33:19,439
Listen carefully now.

791
01:33:19,600 --> 01:33:23,999
When Crusaders go beyond Osman's lands
and reach Konya...

792
01:33:24,120 --> 01:33:27,279
...you'll be Olcaytu's favorite man.

793
01:33:27,480 --> 01:33:33,439
With that power, you will
hit Osman and take his lands.

794
01:33:34,000 --> 01:33:37,279
As the descendant of Kay
Kavus, Governor of Seljuks,

795
01:33:37,360 --> 01:33:40,559
...with the signs of Seljuk dynasty we'll give you,

796
01:33:41,800 --> 01:33:44,999
...you will establish your state.

797
01:33:45,960 --> 01:33:48,759
You made your game, Imren Tegin.

798
01:33:49,320 --> 01:33:52,999
But I swear I will..

799
01:33:53,320 --> 01:33:56,599
...bury you and Crusader looters...

800
01:33:56,800 --> 01:33:59,639
...in these lands.

801
01:34:00,640 --> 01:34:05,719
And I will break Olcaytu's alliance with Crusaders.

802
01:34:06,160 --> 01:34:10,879
I swear I will never let...

803
01:34:11,320 --> 01:34:16,519
...dogs like you in these lands.

804
01:34:17,240 --> 01:34:20,599
Ever.

805
01:34:43,040 --> 01:34:46,439
You never listen, Kanyumaz.

806
01:34:47,200 --> 01:34:49,999
I still have your family.

807
01:34:50,360 --> 01:34:52,479
But you're keeping your nose up.

808
01:34:52,600 --> 01:34:57,319
I will save my family from you, you vile man!

809
01:35:02,600 --> 01:35:05,919
Get him up.

810
01:35:09,640 --> 01:35:14,479
I would cut off your head but I need you.

811
01:35:22,280 --> 01:35:24,999
Uraz Bey's head.

812
01:35:25,680 --> 01:35:29,639
Take this to Osman as my wedding gift.

813
01:35:34,720 --> 01:35:39,279
Osman Bey is going to make you pay for this!

814
01:35:42,640 --> 01:35:45,599
I will be waiting for him in Uraz's tribe.

815
01:35:46,040 --> 01:35:51,239
Tell him to bring me what is mine.

816
01:35:59,600 --> 01:36:01,679
Take him.

817
01:36:16,560 --> 01:36:19,719
Osman Bey is coming!

818
01:36:32,800 --> 01:36:35,119
-Peace be upon you.
-Peace be upon you too.

819
01:36:35,240 --> 01:36:37,199
Peace be upon you too.

820
01:36:37,680 --> 01:36:42,599
-Welcome, my Bey.
-Thank you. Thank you.

821
01:36:44,920 --> 01:36:48,519
Osman Bey. You're back victorious, I hope.

822
01:36:48,600 --> 01:36:52,279
Well, has anyone ever seen me
coming back with empty hands?

823
01:36:53,240 --> 01:36:56,719
You've stood up so fast,
Gunduz Bey? Are you alright?

824
01:36:56,880 --> 01:37:02,599
I'm fine. Heart affairs must
be handled fast, they say.

825
01:37:09,760 --> 01:37:14,359
Well... Did your tribe settle?
-My people are settling.

826
01:37:14,520 --> 01:37:17,719
And I spread five small tribes around it.

827
01:37:17,920 --> 01:37:21,119
Shepherds must be looking for meadows already.

828
01:37:21,400 --> 01:37:26,039
Thank you, thank you, thank you.

829
01:37:27,400 --> 01:37:30,399
Let's get this handled.

830
01:37:31,800 --> 01:37:35,519
Come on then. Let's get
to the girl-asking ceremony.

831
01:37:40,640 --> 01:37:43,079
Let's go.

832
01:37:55,600 --> 01:38:00,759
Holofira, you are making a mistake.
Orhan is going to get engaged with her shortly.

833
01:38:01,120 --> 01:38:05,079
-You can stop that if you want.
-Aunt, please.

834
01:38:05,480 --> 01:38:09,679
I said my final words. Orhan will do his part.

835
01:38:10,320 --> 01:38:14,959
-So will I.
-You will regret this badly, Holofira.

836
01:38:16,080 --> 01:38:19,199
Don't you want your castle?

837
01:38:19,680 --> 01:38:22,159
When Orhan and Elcim get engaged

838
01:38:22,360 --> 01:38:27,719
...two beylics will get united and take
our castle back. You'll get what you want.

839
01:38:29,480 --> 01:38:33,879
Beg to Jesus Christ for no obstacles.

840
01:39:19,360 --> 01:39:21,919
I've seen this blessed day.

841
01:39:22,040 --> 01:39:26,079
Two Kayi tribes have become one state.

842
01:39:26,400 --> 01:39:30,639
-I would nothing else in this world.
-Thank you, thank you, thank you.

843
01:39:30,800 --> 01:39:32,479
Don't worry.

844
01:39:32,520 --> 01:39:35,559
We'll have better days together,
If Allah permits.

845
01:39:35,559 --> 01:39:37,319
If Allah permits.

846
01:39:48,000 --> 01:39:51,599
By accepting this, our children...

847
01:39:51,640 --> 01:39:54,599
...will both start a family...

848
01:39:55,160 --> 01:39:58,599
...and give the biggest
support to our blessed dream.

849
01:39:59,040 --> 01:40:02,079
Thank you, children.

850
01:40:03,520 --> 01:40:06,959
Ulgen, bring the sherbet.

851
01:40:07,040 --> 01:40:10,639
Let's start sweet and finish so.

852
01:40:40,440 --> 01:40:44,439
Everybody knows why we have gathered here.

853
01:40:46,080 --> 01:40:51,599
Starting a family and providing peace for it...

854
01:40:53,360 --> 01:40:56,439
...is as hard as being a state.

855
01:40:56,800 --> 01:41:00,759
Actually, it's even harder.

856
01:41:02,960 --> 01:41:07,559
I'd do everything keep my son Orhan safe.

857
01:41:08,840 --> 01:41:12,919
And he is as fearless as a lion.

858
01:41:13,560 --> 01:41:16,839
To be worthy of the dream of being a state,

859
01:41:17,320 --> 01:41:20,159
...he grew up with the state manners.

860
01:41:21,680 --> 01:41:26,479
-Praise be.
-Well... With daughter Elcim

861
01:41:26,840 --> 01:41:30,199
...he will shoulder this cause.

862
01:41:42,280 --> 01:41:47,079
Allah sent us to these frontiers
to establish a statei and If Allah permits.

863
01:41:47,320 --> 01:41:52,599
...He will let us be a state
to rule all over the world.

864
01:41:52,680 --> 01:41:57,479
-If Allah permits, If Allah permits.
-And this marriage...

865
01:41:58,120 --> 01:42:01,959
...will be one of the biggest steps.

866
01:42:05,280 --> 01:42:10,679
Well... no need for more words.

867
01:42:12,400 --> 01:42:17,479
With the command of Allah
and the word of Prophet (PBUH),

868
01:42:21,440 --> 01:42:24,799
..I want Efendize Elcim Hatun...

869
01:42:27,120 --> 01:42:29,919
...for my son Shahzade Orhan.

870
01:42:36,000 --> 01:42:39,479
I'm Gunduz Bey, Bey of Kayi.

871
01:42:40,040 --> 01:42:46,519
We've gone through a lot of troubles.
A storm flew us to the frontiers.

872
01:42:48,000 --> 01:42:51,199
Thankfully, Osman Bey helped us.

873
01:42:51,360 --> 01:42:55,039
-Thank you, thank you.
-All the trouble...

874
01:42:55,200 --> 01:42:59,759
...made my daughter Elcim stronger than before.

875
01:43:01,440 --> 01:43:06,159
Your dream is my dream, Osman Bey. I follow you.

876
01:43:07,440 --> 01:43:13,559
And my daughter, who is my
only wealth will follow Orhan Bey.

877
01:43:16,800 --> 01:43:22,119
If your dream is the state, we'll
establish it at the cost of our lives.

878
01:43:22,200 --> 01:43:24,719
For sure. For sure.

879
01:43:26,320 --> 01:43:28,799
Let's get to the point.

880
01:43:29,280 --> 01:43:32,919
I can't find a
better son-in-law...

881
01:43:33,160 --> 01:43:36,839
...than Osman Bey's son Orhan Bey.

882
01:43:40,240 --> 01:43:43,319
The girl is yours.

883
01:43:55,080 --> 01:43:59,679
Thank you. Thank you. Come on then.

884
01:44:00,040 --> 01:44:04,799
Let's have a great wedding, huh?

885
01:44:05,200 --> 01:44:11,439
-Come on.
-In the name of Allah.

886
01:44:21,440 --> 01:44:25,199
May it be blessed, my daughter. May it be blessed.

887
01:44:27,920 --> 01:44:32,519
May it be blessed, my daughter. May it be blessed.
-My son...

888
01:44:33,480 --> 01:44:37,359
-May it be blessed.
-Thank you my Bey.

889
01:44:39,360 --> 01:44:42,919
May it be blessed. May it be blessed.
-My beautiful daughter.

890
01:44:43,360 --> 01:44:47,519
May you have a family and
a lineage together If Allah permits.

891
01:44:48,280 --> 01:44:53,199
-My son.
-May it be blessed, my daughter.

892
01:45:01,840 --> 01:45:06,879
-May Allah allow you to complete it, I hope.
-Thank you mother.

893
01:45:08,400 --> 01:45:10,759
My sister...

894
01:45:14,920 --> 01:45:19,359
Brother.. -Brother..

895
01:45:32,880 --> 01:45:38,439
We were both destined to love
but not be together, huh Holofira?

896
01:45:42,400 --> 01:45:47,479
We might not be together, Gonca.
This is what love is.

897
01:45:50,920 --> 01:45:59,079
We loved each other so much. We loved each other
so much that we gave up on our love.

898
01:46:09,880 --> 01:46:11,999
Come on.

899
01:47:06,000 --> 01:47:09,359
The tribe fell, Imren
Tegin. We killed all the Alps!

900
01:47:09,560 --> 01:47:15,319
Come, Osman. I have things to talk to you.

901
01:47:21,520 --> 01:47:26,039
What are we going to do to
women and children, Imren Tegin?

902
01:47:30,000 --> 01:47:36,239
Keep the prisoners. I will use them against Osman.

903
01:48:05,600 --> 01:48:08,359
Gonca Hatun..

904
01:48:28,880 --> 01:48:31,839
What happened Kanyumaz? What happened to you?
-Imren...

905
01:48:31,960 --> 01:48:35,039
I brought news from Imren Tegin.

906
01:48:37,480 --> 01:48:40,959
Kanyumaz, stop! What happened? Tell us!

907
01:48:41,160 --> 01:48:47,999
I fell into the trap of Imren Tegin.
Our Alps died. They let me survive.

908
01:48:51,600 --> 01:48:56,319
What does that dog want? Huh?
What does he want, Kanyumaz?

909
01:48:57,000 --> 01:49:02,159
He wanted me to take Uraz Bey's head to Osman Bey.

910
01:49:10,640 --> 01:49:14,239
Oh no... No... Come on!

911
01:49:14,400 --> 01:49:17,559
Come on, we have to go to the palace now!

912
01:49:25,760 --> 01:49:28,719
Uraz Bey...

913
01:49:29,080 --> 01:49:32,639
The fate of these lands
once again depends on a war.

914
01:49:32,650 --> 01:49:36,120
It is evident that Olcaytu Khan and
the Pope made an agreement...

915
01:49:36,120 --> 01:49:38,280
The formation of the Crusader army proves it.

916
01:49:38,280 --> 01:49:42,079
Imren Tegin is stronger than we thought.

917
01:49:42,200 --> 01:49:47,839
These lands will witness a
greater war than ever before, right?

918
01:49:47,960 --> 01:49:50,519
Either we win this war...

919
01:49:50,720 --> 01:49:54,319
...or we'll break the Ilkhanate-Crusader
alliance. There's no other way.

920
01:49:54,480 --> 01:49:59,879
Thank you, Osman Bey. Know that we'll stand by you
until the last drop of our blood.

921
01:50:00,080 --> 01:50:03,719
But Imren will do everything...

922
01:50:04,000 --> 01:50:07,079
...to take those trusts from you.
-Yes, that's right.

923
01:50:07,240 --> 01:50:10,479
He'll attack even more fiercely than before. But...

924
01:50:10,720 --> 01:50:14,719
...we will never let them
fight on these fertile lands.

925
01:50:14,840 --> 01:50:18,519
-With Allah's consent, we will destroy them.
-If Allah permits, my Bey.

926
01:50:18,880 --> 01:50:20,959
Orhan. -My Bey.

927
01:50:21,320 --> 01:50:26,079
The gold that Olcaytu Khan will
give to Imren.. You will go and take it.

928
01:50:26,240 --> 01:50:31,279
Yes my Bey. Before Olcaytu Khan's
dirty gold sinks our lands into the mud..

929
01:50:31,720 --> 01:50:34,959
..I will go and take it with Allah's consent.
-Thank you my son, thank you.

930
01:50:35,080 --> 01:50:37,879
Praise be to my son, praise be!

931
01:50:39,040 --> 01:50:42,359
-Father!
-Alaeddin!

932
01:50:42,560 --> 01:50:45,399
-Father..
-My son...

933
01:50:45,920 --> 01:50:49,399
-What happened?
-Father...

934
01:50:51,880 --> 01:50:55,839
-We have important news, my Bey.
-Tell him, Kanyumaz.

935
01:50:55,960 --> 01:51:02,279
Osman Bey... Imren Tegin stopped
me on the way and killed my Alps.

936
01:51:05,720 --> 01:51:11,199
-He martyred Uraz Bey, my Bey.
-What are you saying?

937
01:51:12,040 --> 01:51:14,959
What are you saying?

938
01:51:24,800 --> 01:51:28,719
Indeed, to Allah we belong
and to Allah we shall return.

939
01:51:28,880 --> 01:51:34,719
He wanted me to tell you that he is
waiting for you in Uraz Bey's tribe alone.

940
01:51:36,280 --> 01:51:39,319
First, Bayindir Bey...

941
01:51:39,480 --> 01:51:45,999
...now Uraz Bey, huh? It
is time to kill that dog now!

942
01:51:47,280 --> 01:51:51,279
Osman Bey, stop. I will not leave
you alone. I will come with you.

943
01:51:51,400 --> 01:51:53,519
Besides, that dog might play a game.

944
01:51:53,800 --> 01:51:56,119
Alright, alright. Orhan!

945
01:51:56,340 --> 01:51:57,063
My Bey.

946
01:51:57,075 --> 01:51:59,279
Send news to our Alps.
Tell them to go to all the tribes.

947
01:51:59,280 --> 01:52:02,119
That dog might attack our
tribes. They must take precautions.

948
01:52:02,160 --> 01:52:04,839
Yes my Bey. -Go, my son.

949
01:52:04,960 --> 01:52:06,119
-Alaeddin!
-My Bey...

950
01:52:06,240 --> 01:52:08,199
You will protect this place, my son.

951
01:52:08,240 --> 01:52:11,279
Don't worry about it, my Bey. May you come back
with good news If Allah permits.

952
01:52:11,320 --> 01:52:15,879
Good. Konur!
Prepare all of our Alps!

953
01:52:16,320 --> 01:52:20,439
-We need to take that dog's head!
-Yes my Bey. -Come on.

954
01:52:42,920 --> 01:52:43,679
My Bey...

955
01:52:47,280 --> 01:52:51,039
What happened, Kanyumaz?
-My Bey...

956
01:52:51,240 --> 01:52:54,759
Imren Tegin.. beheaded Uraz Bey.

957
01:52:55,080 --> 01:52:58,999
He also... attacked our caravan.

958
01:52:59,200 --> 01:53:06,079
And now... he is waiting for
Osman Bey in Uraz Bey's tribe.

959
01:53:06,600 --> 01:53:09,839
My father was right. He
told me not to trust Osman..

960
01:53:09,960 --> 01:53:13,479
...and this dog who approached for trades.

961
01:53:13,760 --> 01:53:19,959
I will go there with Osman Bey
and question him about this raid.

962
01:53:47,240 --> 01:53:49,519
Orhan Bey...

963
01:53:54,080 --> 01:53:57,119
I want to discuss the issue that disturbs me.

964
01:53:57,280 --> 01:54:01,479
Tell me Elcim Hatun. I am listening to you.

965
01:54:03,440 --> 01:54:09,199
Holofira... While she's here, neither will
there be a wedding, nor will the tribes unite.

966
01:54:09,720 --> 01:54:12,479
Here we are...

967
01:54:15,320 --> 01:54:19,039
May it be good, Elcim Hatun. Did something happen?

968
01:54:19,360 --> 01:54:24,639
What else do you expect? She's
the daughter of enemy lands.

969
01:54:24,760 --> 01:54:28,639
She will only cause issues in these lands.

970
01:54:29,640 --> 01:54:33,159
If she stays here, there
will be bloodshed. Know that.

971
01:54:33,400 --> 01:54:37,719
Elcim Hatun. You are from Hayme mother's lineage..

972
01:54:38,080 --> 01:54:41,279
...you are brave, you are a Bey's daughter...

973
01:54:42,280 --> 01:54:46,079
I can always vouch for you.

974
01:54:47,120 --> 01:54:51,839
But Holofira... I've known her since childhood.

975
01:54:52,280 --> 01:54:55,999
I can also vouch for her.

976
01:54:56,320 --> 01:55:02,759
Holofira is a good and honourable
person who never has bad intentions.

977
01:55:07,480 --> 01:55:13,839
Good... So that you know her well..

978
01:55:16,560 --> 01:55:22,159
...if she makes a mistake,
you will be responsible for that.

979
01:55:44,480 --> 01:55:49,319
Thanks to Allah, we have prepared everything.

980
01:55:53,760 --> 01:56:00,119
Malhun? Why are you sad instead of being happy?

981
01:56:00,960 --> 01:56:05,479
I am worried, Bala. Olivia
and Holofira are still here.

982
01:56:05,680 --> 01:56:10,559
I cannot trust them. I am afraid
Orhan might make a mistake.

983
01:56:10,800 --> 01:56:18,279
You are right. You are right. The test
of Orhan and Holofira is really difficult.

984
01:56:18,960 --> 01:56:21,439
We need to solve this as soon as possible.

985
01:56:21,440 --> 01:56:25,199
Even if Holofira is innocent, she needs
to leave the palace as soon as possible.

986
01:56:25,200 --> 01:56:29,559
Or else... I don't even want to
think about what is going to happen.

987
01:56:32,560 --> 01:56:36,959
Anyway... Forget about me. I couldn't ask you
because I was dealing with my own problems.

988
01:56:37,160 --> 01:56:42,959
What do you think about Gonca?
What is going to happen to them?

989
01:56:43,080 --> 01:56:46,719
I don't know Malhun. Believe me, I don't know.

990
01:56:47,320 --> 01:56:49,799
Gonca saved Alaeddin's life.

991
01:56:49,960 --> 01:56:53,119
She loves him enough to
give up on her life, it's obvious.

992
01:56:53,440 --> 01:56:58,279
But... I am worried about Mehmed, Bala.

993
01:56:58,880 --> 01:57:03,279
Mehmed... He acts without thinking.

994
01:57:03,400 --> 01:57:08,799
What if he does something to
Alaeddin? It won't just affect my son...

995
01:57:08,920 --> 01:57:13,039
...it will turn two Beylics into
enemies. There might be a war, Malhun.

996
01:57:13,240 --> 01:57:16,039
If they shed blood, there will be a disaster.

997
01:57:16,360 --> 01:57:18,959
But... it's not just that.

998
01:57:19,160 --> 01:57:23,039
Let's assume we convinced and stopped Mehmed.

999
01:57:24,120 --> 01:57:28,199
Gonca... Do you trust Gonca, Bala?

1000
01:57:28,320 --> 01:57:32,079
She will attend our meetings if they get married.

1001
01:57:32,200 --> 01:57:37,759
-We will share the secrets of our state.
-That's what I ask myself every day.

1002
01:57:38,000 --> 01:57:40,599
Do I trust Gonca?

1003
01:57:41,920 --> 01:57:44,799
My heart says... "This is love.

1004
01:57:45,480 --> 01:57:48,279
Her love for Alaeddin will outweigh everything.

1005
01:57:48,520 --> 01:57:51,119
She won't betray us again."

1006
01:57:51,360 --> 01:57:54,521
But... what if something
happens between us and

1007
01:57:54,533 --> 01:57:57,639
Germiyans? With her
family on the other end...

1008
01:57:57,760 --> 01:58:01,279
...will she still be on Alaeddin's side, our side?

1009
01:58:01,520 --> 01:58:07,119
We will see what she is going to
when her family is involved, Bala.

1010
01:58:07,600 --> 01:58:10,399
May my Allah protect our children.

1011
01:58:10,520 --> 01:58:13,479
Ameen, Bala Hatun.

1012
01:58:14,560 --> 01:58:20,359
How are they still keeping
this girl at the castle, aunt?

1013
01:58:22,480 --> 01:58:26,079
You will see, there is something behind this.

1014
01:58:26,240 --> 01:58:29,039
Enough of this. Stop thinking about it.

1015
01:58:29,200 --> 01:58:34,279
-Look, if this girl bothers you this much..
-It is not about me, aunt.

1016
01:58:34,400 --> 01:58:37,319
I am thinking of my tribe.

1017
01:58:37,520 --> 01:58:40,599
What if Imren attacks our tribe?

1018
01:58:40,720 --> 01:58:45,039
I know, you are trying to
protect your tribe, Elcim.

1019
01:58:54,920 --> 01:58:59,959
Now, if your brother, my valiant soldier lived..

1020
01:59:02,800 --> 01:59:06,719
..he would've carried all this weight.

1021
01:59:07,560 --> 01:59:12,399
Then, I would be the Hatun of a Bey.

1022
01:59:12,680 --> 01:59:19,199
-We would divide all this trouble with my valiant.
-Aunt.

1023
01:59:20,680 --> 01:59:24,239
Now, all this weight is on your shoulders.

1024
01:59:29,440 --> 01:59:32,879
I know your pain.

1025
01:59:33,120 --> 01:59:38,159
You are entrusted to us from my
brother. Do not think yourself a burden.

1026
01:59:41,640 --> 01:59:44,799
No. I do not think like that.

1027
01:59:48,920 --> 01:59:51,559
However, I feel sorry for you, Elcim.

1028
01:59:52,960 --> 01:59:57,639
You are marrying with Orhan, a Shahzade.

1029
01:59:58,360 --> 02:00:04,479
This weight would be heavier.
And you will carry this alone.

1030
02:00:06,360 --> 02:00:10,839
Still, my aunt. This is my destiny.

1031
02:01:15,120 --> 02:01:20,159
Alps are ready, my Bey. They
are waiting for the ambush.

1032
02:01:30,200 --> 02:01:33,559
Their commander is coming, my Bey.

1033
02:01:35,760 --> 02:01:40,999
Let him come.

1034
02:01:44,240 --> 02:01:49,679
There will not be war. Women
and the people are our captives.

1035
02:01:49,960 --> 02:01:56,039
If you draw a sword, will
kill both women and children.

1036
02:02:00,800 --> 02:02:05,439
Look here!

1037
02:02:06,000 --> 02:02:10,399
You haven't seen the sharp side of our swords!

1038
02:02:11,480 --> 02:02:15,039
So keep it short. Open this road.

1039
02:02:15,600 --> 02:02:19,599
Imren Tegin wants to see you
alone at the tribe, Osman Bey.

1040
02:02:19,760 --> 02:02:23,559
Our decision is this. You will
see each other alone, otherwise..

1041
02:02:23,720 --> 02:02:28,799
Shut it!

1042
02:02:29,560 --> 02:02:35,559
Who are you? I am not here to talk with a servant!

1043
02:02:37,280 --> 02:02:42,519
Open this road! Or I know how to make you.

1044
02:03:00,520 --> 02:03:03,039
-Cerkutay.
-My Bey.

1045
02:03:03,160 --> 02:03:06,039
-Solgur Aga.
-Yes, my Bey.

1046
02:03:06,360 --> 02:03:09,319
You will find me those captives.

1047
02:03:09,480 --> 02:03:13,759
Even if they vanish.

1048
02:03:14,000 --> 02:03:16,719
You will find them and bring them to me.

1049
02:03:16,880 --> 02:03:20,639
-As you command, my Bey.
-As you command, my Bey.

1050
02:03:22,440 --> 02:03:28,399
Osman Bey, be careful. There
dogs can not be trusted as you know.

1051
02:03:28,640 --> 02:03:31,011
They might've set up a trap.

1052
02:03:31,023 --> 02:03:33,159
Do not worry Gunduz Bey.

1053
02:03:33,440 --> 02:03:36,359
Let them set their traps.

1054
02:03:37,240 --> 02:03:40,839
My Allah is greater than them.

1055
02:04:16,640 --> 02:04:19,679
I am thinking about the future.

1056
02:04:19,840 --> 02:04:25,719
You will see, after this marriage
we will heal all our wounds.

1057
02:04:27,120 --> 02:04:31,199
You will smile like before too.

1058
02:04:32,480 --> 02:04:34,639
Aunt?

1059
02:04:46,080 --> 02:04:49,039
Aunt, what happened?

1060
02:04:50,200 --> 02:04:57,199
Are you alright? Aunt?

1061
02:04:57,440 --> 02:05:01,999
Aunt? Help us!

1062
02:05:03,040 --> 02:05:06,519
-My girl, what is happening here?
-Ayca?

1063
02:05:07,000 --> 02:05:09,919
-What happened?
-Mother, Gonca..

1064
02:05:10,120 --> 02:05:13,959
..bring her up and make her vomit, I'll be back.
-Come on.

1065
02:05:16,320 --> 02:05:19,879
Come on aunt.

1066
02:05:24,120 --> 02:05:28,679
Alps! Send word to healers, let them come here!

1067
02:05:30,320 --> 02:05:32,839
Doctors?

1068
02:05:38,480 --> 02:05:42,279
-What's going on, my Shahzade? -Wait here.

1069
02:05:46,200 --> 02:05:50,159
-Did she puke, mother?
-Yes, she did. Look.

1070
02:05:50,960 --> 02:05:54,679
What is it, son? Poison?

1071
02:05:59,120 --> 02:06:02,359
Not good, mother. She's poisoned.

1072
02:06:02,600 --> 02:06:05,159
Poisoned?

1073
02:06:05,600 --> 02:06:09,559
-What poison?
-I don't know, Gonca.

1074
02:06:11,760 --> 02:06:15,159
We need to find first the poison and then the cure.

1075
02:06:15,680 --> 02:06:18,439
Or we will lose Ayca Hatun.

1076
02:06:22,960 --> 02:06:25,399
What happened here, Elcim Hatun?

1077
02:06:25,640 --> 02:06:28,319
It happened after she drank water.

1078
02:06:28,400 --> 02:06:30,679
Water?

1079
02:06:40,560 --> 02:06:46,559
Gonca Hatun, make her drink this.
It will relieve her pains for a while.

1080
02:06:59,000 --> 02:07:02,119
-Open her mouth, Bala Hatun.
-Bring it.

1081
02:07:03,910 --> 02:07:05,689
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate.

1082
02:07:05,689 --> 02:07:08,039
O Healer!
O Healer!

1083
02:07:10,320 --> 02:07:13,439
-O Healer!
-Drink it.

1084
02:07:17,880 --> 02:07:21,639
Who would poison you and why?

1085
02:07:22,720 --> 02:07:28,159
They were going to poison
me but my aunt got poisoned.

1086
02:07:38,720 --> 02:07:41,639
Help us, my Allah.

1087
02:09:15,760 --> 02:09:17,879
-What's going on?
-You...

1088
02:09:18,160 --> 02:09:22,439
You did this. You wanted to kill. My aunt is dying!

1089
02:09:22,640 --> 02:09:25,479
-What do you think you are saying?
-Still asking?

1090
02:09:25,520 --> 02:09:28,279
You wanted to poison me but poisoned my aunt!

1091
02:09:28,400 --> 02:09:31,759
You're blinded by your
anger. I didn't poison anyone.

1092
02:09:31,880 --> 02:09:35,039
-There are no other enemies but you here!
-Pull yourself together.

1093
02:09:35,240 --> 02:09:39,359
-Aunt!
-My lady!

1094
02:09:55,760 --> 02:09:58,639
My lady!

1095
02:10:08,320 --> 02:10:13,239
Holofira... Holofira! Holofira.

1096
02:10:13,560 --> 02:10:18,479
Holofira. Holofira. Holofira!

1097
02:10:18,920 --> 02:10:22,519
Open your eyes, Holofira.

1098
02:10:23,040 --> 02:10:25,959
Inform doctors and Alaaddin!

1099
02:10:26,600 --> 02:10:30,439
Elcim Hatun, what have you done?

1100
02:11:49,960 --> 02:11:53,639
I knew you would come with empty hands, Osman Bey.

1101
02:11:56,800 --> 02:11:59,679
You know me well.

1102
02:12:02,440 --> 02:12:05,839
I brought you only blood and bones.

1103
02:12:21,840 --> 02:12:26,719
What? Will you protect yourself with these?

1104
02:12:31,280 --> 02:12:34,759
I invited you here so you could deliver the signs.

1105
02:12:35,080 --> 02:12:39,239
-To talk.
-Are you hiding behind the prisoners?

1106
02:12:41,280 --> 02:12:44,199
Not only by using the prisoners,

1107
02:12:44,640 --> 02:12:50,239
...but also by killing all the
warriors and beys in the tribe.

1108
02:12:51,840 --> 02:12:56,119
See my strength and don't
stand in my way, Osman Bey.

1109
02:12:56,560 --> 02:12:59,759
You will give me the signs.

1110
02:13:00,160 --> 02:13:04,639
If I know you a little, you
must have hidden them already.

1111
02:13:05,400 --> 02:13:10,239
I don't want to kill you. Because
only you must know where they are.

1112
02:13:10,600 --> 02:13:14,079
You will never be able to find the signs.

1113
02:13:14,600 --> 02:13:19,959
-Ever.
-Well... If you say so...

1114
02:13:20,600 --> 02:13:25,079
Then I will kill all the prisoners.

1115
02:13:25,800 --> 02:13:28,519
"Osman Bey sacrificed women and children....

1116
02:13:28,680 --> 02:13:32,319
...for a few ancient items", people will say.

1117
02:13:32,480 --> 02:13:37,399
-And you'll walk with shame.
-I will take the prisoners from you.

1118
02:13:38,160 --> 02:13:44,759
You'll talk about the Crusader
army to come to my lands.

1119
02:13:46,000 --> 02:13:50,959
You arranged an agreement
between Olcaytu and Crusaders.

1120
02:13:51,640 --> 02:13:53,319
Now tell me.

1121
02:13:53,840 --> 02:13:58,919
Which countries in the east
are going to join the campaign?

1122
02:13:59,160 --> 02:14:04,559
Give me what is mine Osman. Right now!

1123
02:14:04,800 --> 02:14:08,319
You have nothing to take from these lands.

1124
02:14:08,600 --> 02:14:15,359
I will destroy both you and those Crusader looters!

1125
02:14:17,040 --> 02:14:21,479
The only thing you will take
will be my sword of justice.

1126
02:14:36,128 --> 02:14:48,698
Visit turkision.com for more!